# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ServiceLoader registration - the cleanest of the three ways to register a
# TestNG listener.
#
#   1. this file        -> applies to EVERY suite, no XML edits, nothing to
#                          forget when someone adds a new suite. Used for the
#                          cross-cutting listeners below.
#   2. <listeners> in a suite XML -> applies to that one suite. See
#                          suites/04-groups-and-filters.xml (SmokeFirstInterceptor).
#   3. @Listeners on a class      -> applies to that one class. See
#                          com.sk.tests.listeners.ListenerShowcaseTest.
#
# Order in this file does not decide callback order; TestNG groups listeners by
# interface and calls each group in its own defined order.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
com.sk.listeners.ExecutionLifecycleListener
com.sk.listeners.SuiteExecutionListener
com.sk.listeners.TestExecutionListener
com.sk.listeners.MethodInvocationListener
com.sk.listeners.ConfigurationLogListener
com.sk.listeners.RetryTransformer
com.sk.listeners.ExecutionSummaryReporter
